Example

Suppose our embedding size is:

8 dimensions

and we use:

4 attention heads

Each head gets:

2 dimensions

Example:

Embedding

[1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8]

Split:

Head1 → [1 2]

Head2 → [3 4]

Head3 → [5 6]

Head4 → [7 8]

Each head performs self-attention independently.

After Attention

Outputs are concatenated:

Head1 output

[10 11]

Head2 output

[20 21]

Head3 output

[30 31]

Head4 output

[40 41]

Combined:

[10 11 20 21 30 31 40 41]
